# One person, two names, one address. Git history carries both "DCJ" and
# "Jack Brandt" against jack@dotcomjack.com, so `git shortlog -sn` reports two
# contributors and the Swift Package Index would headline the acronym as the
# author of a security library.
#
# Because both spellings share the same commit address, the single name form is
# enough. The two address mapping form is not needed here.
Jack Brandt <jack@dotcomjack.com>
